    "text": "I, Hettiyakandage Arunapushpa Saumyasiri Fernando, Returning Officer of the Nuwara Eliya Pradeshiya Sabha, do herebydeclare under Section 10A(1)(a) of the (Chapter 262) Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, that Mr. Kathiravel SivapragasamSachithananthan of the Nuwara Eliya Pradeshiya Sabha has vacated his office of the member of that Pradeshiya Sabha ashe has ceased to be a member of the Up - Country People\u2019s front.",
